"""Summarize terminal scoped checks and complete actual original transports."""
from pathlib import Path
import datetime,hashlib,json
OUT=Path(__file__).resolve().parent
BASE='ebd87c26ec9adefe85461c3f71dcf5f77c795e34'
def seal(p):
 raw=Path(p).read_bytes();return {'path':str(p),'bytes':len(raw),'sha256':hashlib.sha256(raw).hexdigest()}
epochs=[json.loads(p.read_bytes())for p in OUT.glob('*/inputs.json')if(p.parent/'run-checks.py').exists()];executions=[]
for p in sorted(OUT.glob('*/*/result.json')):
 d=json.loads(p.read_bytes())
 if'command'not in d:continue
 assert d['status']in {'passed','failed'}
 for key in ['stdout','stderr']:assert seal(d[key]['path'])==d[key]
 executions.append({'result':seal(p),'status':d['status'],'command':d['command']})
assert len(epochs)==26 and sum(len(e['sources'])for e in epochs)==20013 and len(executions)==48 and sum(r['status']=='failed'for r in executions)==4
checks={'Go-native':OUT/'aliases-formatted/go-oracle/result.json','Go-vet':OUT/'aliases-final/vet/result.json','Go-format':OUT/'aliases-final/go-format/result.json','Rust-value-typing':OUT/'aliases-final/rust-values/result.json','Rust-scalar-typing':OUT/'aliases-final/rust-selected/result.json','Clippy':OUT/'aliases-formatted/clippy/result.json','Rust-format':OUT/'aliases-final/rust-format/result.json'}
for p in checks.values():assert json.loads(p.read_bytes())['status']=='passed'
audit=json.loads((OUT/'final-alias-original-byte-audit/result.json').read_bytes());assert audit['status']=='passed'
names=['native-original','rust-element-partial','rust-context-partial','native-context-original','rust-context-original','native-methods-partial','scalar-original','native-methods-original','rust-original','native-index-original','rust-index-original','scalar-index-original','native-alias-original','rust-alias-original','scalar-alias-original']
record={'status':'scoped_checks_passed','basis_commit':BASE,'observed_at_utc':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'source_languages':['Go','Rust'],'current_checks':{k:seal(p)for k,p in checks.items()},'actual_executions':executions,'source_epochs':26,'whole_source_preimages':20013,'original_failed_checks':4,'actual_cases':950,'exact_positive_type_value_addressability_and_nil_context_outcomes':474,'agreeing_actual_rejections':463,'explicit_valid_Go_outside_value_typing':13,'Rust_value_typing_roots':2,'affected_existing_scalar_roots':3,'previous_scalar_cases':4985,'previous_scalar_exact_positives':2776,'previous_scalar_agreeing_rejections':2205,'previous_scalar_remaining_unmodeled':4,'previously_unmodeled_aggregate_len_now_exact':True,'previous_deep_contextual_unary_nodes':20000,'original_archives':[seal(OUT/name/'manifest.json')for name in names],'complete_original_files':audit['actual_original_files_compared_literally'],'complete_original_bytes':audit['actual_original_bytes_compared_literally'],'literal_byte_mode_audit':seal(OUT/'final-alias-original-byte-audit/result.json'),'derived_native_corpus':seal(OUT/'derived-aliases-native/result.json'),'earlier_actual_native_corpora':[seal(OUT/name/'result.json')for name in ['derived-native','derived-context-native','derived-methods-native','derived-indices-native']],'SDK_current_exact':seal(OUT/'sdk-check/result.json'),'previous_scalar_typing_basis':seal(OUT.parent/'scalar-typing/verification.json'),'previous_signature_basis':seal(OUT.parent/'source-signatures/verification.json'),'previous_source_type_basis':seal(OUT.parent/'source-types/verification.json'),'previous_scalar_basis':seal(OUT.parent/'source-constants/verification.json'),'previous_scope_basis':seal(OUT.parent/'source-scopes/verification.json'),'unchanged_parser_basis':seal(OUT.parent/'go-parse/verification.json'),'unchanged_lexer_basis':seal(OUT.parent/'go-lex/verification.json'),'unchanged_frontend_basis':seal(OUT.parent/'type-keys/corrected/analysis-inputs/captured-inputs.json'),'unchanged_ordinary_basis':seal(OUT.parent/'storage-lens/verification.json'),'unchanged_ordinary_paired_basis':seal(OUT.parent/'storage-lens/paired/result.json'),'original_failures':['Strict Clippy identified a large pending-plan enum after adding three slice bounds; store those bounds indirectly without lint suppression.','Original source comparison exposed accepting an elided literal type in a struct field; only array/slice element context permits that omission.','A complete comparison retained six differences: a valid enormous slice literal was rejected by an extra allocation bound, and raw untyped nil observations were not separated from actual destination materialization. The type-only reader now accepts that literal and preserves nil origin plus its actual expected type.','After removing unused-variable noise from a method reference case, the actual observer found that the method was shallower than the field. A true same-depth field/method ambiguity is now checked; incomplete original native outputs remain untouched.'],'review_added_index_context_regressions':'Original Go index checking gives untyped operands type int, including nonconstant shifts; explicit original index context now checks huge shifted constants and large runes before access typing. Dynamic uint64 indices retain their types and are not range proofs.','review_added_alias_receiver_controls':'Method barriers use actual original receiver denotation, including local value/pointer aliases, rather than spelling. Six additional actual native cases preserve all earlier944 input/outcome rows exactly.','earlier_scoped_review_originals':seal(OUT/'review-indices/manifest.json'),'language_type_limits':{'array_length':256,'struct_fields':64,'aggregate_depth':16,'results':16},'scalar_aggregate_expression_typing_component':True,'make_append_copy_methods_interfaces_and_full_expression_typing_complete':False,'whole_body_assignment_statement_or_invocation_state_typechecking':False,'ordinary_source_evaluation_or_carrier_proof':False,'complete_nominal_import_module_build_capture_context_authority':False,'source_program_or_registered_profile_authority':False,'full_U_Plain_weight_depth_counts_or_capture_budget_proved':False,'public_profile_activated':False,'R01_complete':False,'R06_complete':False,'W01_complete':False,'native_Linux_release_acceptance':False,'full_T_gate':'deferred to GO-PRAC-T02-W04: ./scripts/check-fast.sh'}
(OUT/'verification.json').write_text(json.dumps(record,indent=2)+'\n');print(json.dumps({key:record[key]for key in ['status','source_epochs','whole_source_preimages','complete_original_files','complete_original_bytes']}))
